{"seq":3,"slug":"model-serving","title":"模型服务化部署","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fine-tuning/evaluation-deployment/model-serving","wordCount":746,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"模型服务化部署\">模型服务化部署</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>微调完成后，模型需要通过推理服务对外提供能力。模型服务化涵盖推理引擎选择、API 设计、批处理优化和扩展策略。对于 LLM 来说，推理的核心瓶颈是自回归生成的顺序性——每个 Token 的生成都依赖前一个 Token，这使得传统的并行化策略效果有限。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[微调模型] --&gt; B{部署方式}&#10;    B --&gt; C[vLLM]&#10;    B --&gt; D[TGI]&#10;    B --&gt; E[Ollama]&#10;    B --&gt; F[TensorRT-LLM]&#10;    C --&gt; G[API 服务]&#10;    D --&gt; G&#10;    E --&gt; H[本地推理]&#10;    F --&gt; I[高性能推理]\">graph TB\n    A[微调模型] --&gt; B{部署方式}\n    B --&gt; C[vLLM]\n    B --&gt; D[TGI]\n    B --&gt; E[Ollama]\n    B --&gt; F[TensorRT-LLM]\n    C --&gt; G[API 服务]\n    D --&gt; G\n    E --&gt; H[本地推理]\n    F --&gt; I[高性能推理]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>推理引擎</th>\n<th>吞吐量</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n<th>易用性</th>\n<th>显存效率</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>vLLM</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>最好</td>\n<td>生产推理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TGI</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>HuggingFace 生态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ollama</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>本地开发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TensorRT-LLM</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>NVIDIA GPU 优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>llama.cpp</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>CPU/混合推理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"vllm-部署\">vLLM 部署</h2><p>vLLM 是当前最流行的 LLM 推理引擎，其核心创新是 PagedAttention——借鉴操作系统的虚拟内存管理，动态分配 KV Cache 内存，将 GPU 利用率从传统方案的 30-50% 提升到 90% 以上：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"pip install vllm&#10;&#10;python -m vllm.entrypoints.openai.api_server \\&#10;  --model ./fine-tuned-model \\&#10;  --served-model-name my-model \\&#10;  --host 0.0.0.0 \\&#10;  --port 8000 \\&#10;  --max-model-len 4096 \\&#10;  --gpu-memory-utilization 0.9 \\&#10;  --tensor-parallel-size 1 \\&#10;  --quantization awq \\&#10;  --dtype bfloat16\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pip</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> vllm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">python</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> vllm.entrypoints.openai.api_server</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --model</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./fine-tuned-model</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --served-model-name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-model</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --host</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.0.0.0</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --port</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 8000</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --max-model-len</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4096</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --gpu-memory-utilization</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.9</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --tensor-parallel-size</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --quantization</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> awq</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --dtype</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bfloat16</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const callVLLM = async (prompt: string): Promise&lt;string&gt; =&gt; {&#10;  const response = await fetch(&#39;http://localhost:8000/v1/chat/completions&#39;, {&#10;    method: &#39;POST&#39;,&#10;    headers: { &#39;Content-Type&#39;: &#39;application/json&#39; },&#10;    body: JSON.stringify({&#10;      model: &#39;my-model&#39;,&#10;      messages: [{ role: &#39;user&#39;, content: prompt }],&#10;      max_tokens: 1024,&#10;      temperature: 0.7,&#10;      stream: false,&#10;    }),&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  const data = await response.json();&#10;  return data.choices[0].message.content;&#10;};&#10;&#10;const streamVLLM = async function* (prompt: string) {&#10;  const response = await fetch(&#39;http://localhost:8000/v1/chat/completions&#39;, {&#10;    method: &#39;POST&#39;,&#10;    headers: { &#39;Content-Type&#39;: &#39;application/json&#39; },&#10;    body: JSON.stringify({&#10;      model: &#39;my-model&#39;,&#10;      messages: [{ role: &#39;user&#39;, content: prompt }],&#10;      max_tokens: 1024,&#10;      stream: true,&#10;    }),&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  const reader = response.body!.getReader();&#10;  const decoder = new TextDecoder();&#10;&#10;  while (true) {&#10;    const { done, value } = await reader.read();&#10;    if (done) break;&#10;    const chunk = decoder.decode(value);&#10;    const lines = chunk.split(&#39;\\n&#39;).filter((l) =&gt; l.startsWith(&#39;data: &#39;));&#10;    for (const line of lines) {&#10;      const data = line.replace(&#39;data: &#39;, &#39;&#39;);&#10;      if (data === &#39;[DONE]&#39;) return;&#10;      const parsed = JSON.parse(data);&#10;      const content = parsed.choices[0]?.delta?.content;&#10;      if (content) yield content;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> callVLLM</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">prompt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> re