制 GPU 显存使用比例（生产环境建议 0.85-0.9），<code>tensor-parallel-size</code> 设置张量并行的 GPU 数量，<code>max-model-len</code> 限制最大序列长度以控制 KV Cache 内存。</p>\n<h2 id=\"批处理与并发优化\">批处理与并发优化</h2><p>Continuous Batching（连续批处理）是现代 LLM 推理的核心优化。它允许新请求在前一批请求的不同生成阶段加入处理，避免了传统静态批处理中短请求等待长请求的问题：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface BatchConfig {&#10;  maxBatchSize: number;&#10;  maxWaitTimeMs: number;&#10;  maxTokenBudget: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const defaultBatchConfig: BatchConfig = {&#10;  maxBatchSize: 32,&#10;  maxWaitTimeMs: 100,&#10;  maxTokenBudget: 32768,&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BatchConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  maxBatchSize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  maxWaitTimeMs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  maxTokenBudget</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> defaultBatchConfig</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BatchConfig</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  maxBatchSize: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  maxWaitTimeMs: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  maxTokenBudget: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32768</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>批处理策略</th>\n<th>吞吐量</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n<th>GPU 利用率</th>\n<th>实现复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>静态批处理</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高（等待）</td>\n<td>30-50%</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态批处理</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>50-70%</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连续批处理</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>85-95%</td>\n<td>复杂</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"多模型与-lora-热切换\">多模型与 LoRA 热切换</h2><p>生产环境经常需要同时服务多个微调版本的模型。vLLM 支持同一基础模型上动态加载多个 LoRA 适配器：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"python -m vllm.entrypoints.openai.api_server \\&#10;  --model Qwen/Qwen3-8B \\&#10;  --enable-lora \\&#10;  --lora-modules \\&#10;    customer-service=./lora-adapters/customer-service \\&#10;    code-review=./lora-adapters/code-review \\&#10;    medical-qa=./lora